# A butcher's shop makes meat of the pigs the castle sends it: the butcher stands inside from the start, two pigs lie on the castle's flag, a
# carrier takes them over the road to the shop's flag and on into the shop, the butcher works on each, and the meat goes back to the castle.
# The script fast-forwards to the castle's first meat beyond its start stock and takes a shot of the shop and its road. Run it on the layout,
# under either graphics source:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh butcher --layout layouts/butcher.jsonc --fps 10
#   sh tools/play-run.sh butcher --layout layouts/butcher.jsonc --fps 10 --graphics open-settlers
wait 0.3
expect-at 13 10 building
fast-forward until meat >= 2 max 30000
scroll up 6 860 560
wait 0.3
dump meat-stored
shot meat-stored
expect meat >= 2
